- Layout refinements for the triple-pane setup.

### [MODIFY] [index.html](file:///c:/Users/tiegb/Documents/bvmbino%20ai%20agent/public/index.html)
- Update `<nav>`, `<aside>`, and `<main>` structures to support modern flex/grid layouts.
- Integrate placeholders for the new Settings and Portfolio modals.

### [MODIFY] [core.js](file:///c:/Users/tiegb/Documents/bvmbino%20ai%20agent/public/js/core.js)
- Enhance `SYSTEM_IDENTITY` for the "Bvmbino Chef" persona v4.0.
- Update `CMDS` and `PROMPTS` to include `/aimas` and `/aros`.

### [MODIFY] [ui.js](file:///c:/Users/tiegb/Documents/bvmbino%20ai%20agent/public/js/ui.js)
- Implement `renderEmpirePortfolio()` with Add/Delete logic.
- Add handlers for the new Temperature and Streaming sliders.
- Refine the `renderMemoryFeed()` logic to use a chip-based visualization.

### [MODIFY] [store.js](file:///c:/Users/tiegb/Documents/bvmbino%20ai%20agent/public/js/store.js)
- Enhance the `Vault` storage scheme to support partitioned keys and memory feed persistence.

